                <mxCell id="GPBo2WPaIK_RgOL0tFQZ-46" value="&lt;b&gt;Stall/Unlock Priority (always @*)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Update order in code:&lt;br&gt;1) unlock events: wspawn/tmc/split/join/barrier/branch/decode/csr&lt;br&gt;2) then schedule_fire: stalled_warps_n[schedule_wid] = 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Net effect:&lt;/b&gt; if same cycle has unlock + schedule_fire&lt;br&gt;on same wid, stall wins in next state." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#5d4037;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="GPBo2WPaIK_RgOL0tFQZ-1">
